  "details": "Instead of limiting users to android worlds, there should be a experimental feature with would allow them to join PC instances.\n\nThis can be done with asynchronous rendering and asynchronous graphics. \n\nPlus a distance viewfilter, that would just be a 'reflection' of the whole map. Making the Illusion that the user sees the whole map rendered. While it would be just a prefetched a Image [JPG,PNG] of the map with 3 Illusionary effect.  Either from client side or locally.\n\nThey done similar things in older games like GTA 3,Vice city, San andreas and many other games. \n\nI think it might be hard to do, as the engine or even the game would require a lot of changes.",
